# Flutter/Dart/Pub related
**/doc/api/
**/ios/Flutter/.last_build_id
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
.pub-cache/
.pub/
/build/
/coverage/

# Symbolication related
app.*.symbols

# Obfuscation related
app.*.map.json

# Android Studio will place build artifacts here
/android/app/debug
/android/app/profile
/android/app/release

# Xcode-generated SwiftPM workspace state
**/xcshareddata/swiftpm/

# third_party/speech_to_text is a local fork (see MORSE_ICR_FORK.md) of
# just the plugin itself -- its own example app and local.properties
# (machine-specific SDK paths, one leaked from the original upstream
# maintainer's machine) aren't needed for the dependency_overrides path
# reference in pubspec.yaml to work, and don't belong in this repo.
third_party/speech_to_text/example/
third_party/speech_to_text/**/local.properties
